%% TBOS Navigation System — device patterns and role-scoped visibility
%% See 08_NAVIGATION_SYSTEM.md and 07_INFORMATION_ARCHITECTURE.md for full reasoning.

flowchart TB
    User(["Broker logs in"]) --> RoleCheck{"RBAC role\n(Settings → Team & Roles)"}

    RoleCheck -->|"Solo Broker /\nAgency Owner"| FullTree["Full navigation tree visible"]
    RoleCheck -->|"Sales Manager"| ScopedSM["Full tree except\nFinance/Wallet by default"]
    RoleCheck -->|"Marketing Manager"| ScopedMM["Properties, Projects, Owners,\nMarketing, Analytics, Knowledge"]
    RoleCheck -->|"Operations Manager"| ScopedOM["Contracts, Compliance Docs,\nKnowledge, full Analytics (read-only elsewhere)"]
    RoleCheck -->|"Property Consultant"| ScopedPC["Own Leads/Customers/Contracts only —\nno Team, Finance, or agency Analytics"]
    RoleCheck -->|"Administrator"| Console["Platform Console ONLY —\nzero Broker OS access, by architecture"]

    FullTree --> Device{"Device"}
    ScopedSM --> Device
    ScopedMM --> Device
    ScopedOM --> Device
    ScopedPC --> Device

    Device -->|"Desktop"| Desktop["Persistent left rail,\n3 collapsible layer-groups,\ntop bar: search + quick action + notifications"]
    Device -->|"Tablet"| Tablet["Icons-only rail,\nexpandable on tap"]
    Device -->|"Mobile"| Mobile["Bottom tab bar (5 items):\nHome · Today · Search · Quick Actions · Notifications"]

    Desktop --> GlobalSearch["Global Search\n(primary nav method for any list > ~15 items)"]
    Tablet --> GlobalSearch
    Mobile --> GlobalSearch

    Desktop --> QuickActions["Quick Actions:\nAdd Lead · Add Property ·\nLog Follow-up · Submit Compliance Doc"]
    Mobile --> QuickActions

    GlobalSearch --> AnyEntity["Any entity, any module,\nranked by relevance + recency,\nRBAC-scoped results only"]

